# Telegram notification when someone submits the RSVP form. Optional — RSVPs
# still save locally without these; the notification is just skipped.
#
# 1. Message @BotFather on Telegram, run /newbot, and copy the token it gives you.
# 2. Send your new bot any message, then open (in a browser, while signed in)
#    https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates and read "chat":{"id":...}
#    from the response — that's your TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
